ociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.rc2.mono.official [3df26a02c]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc2.mono - Windows 10 (build 17134) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3141) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-7700 CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads) - 23.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (96000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nRichTextLabel's size aware images can have images in the wrong position if the font size changes size in the same line.\nIt seems to use the biggest font size in the line as reference, so the smaller line images are put way above the text.\n\n<img width=\"797\" height=\"130\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c85a07d-09d7-4e96-aadd-83627e9cc47b\" />\n\nIt seems to use the vertical alignment of the biggest font size in the line. So it returns to normal by jumping a line.\n\n<img width=\"566\" height=\"178\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f94f2478-0ea2-4760-b3d1-2cd286a7e6be\" />\n\n**Manually** changing the alignment also **does not seems to be working**, producing unexpected results or none at all.\n\n<img width=\"558\" height=\"215\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa31a441-77c1-4709-883f-21025fb62ebb\" />\n\n<img width=\"451\" height=\"249\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/471fd2a6-8227-47ed-9e0a-16674c429b91\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a textRichLabel\n- Enable BB code and input a font-size aware image, then change the font size for something bigger in the same line\n\nResult: Image is displayed aligned to the top of the biggest line. Manual alignment also does not work\n\nExpected: Image sized to the font_size it has. Manual alignment should also work and be related to the font_size it is related to.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rich text icon fail MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28925046/rich.text.icon.fail.MRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120281/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}